    "detailed_description": "<i>A Slug\u2019s Dream</i> is a challenging yet accessible puzzle game about guiding an adorable slug dreaming about scrumptious flowers after skipping dinner through increasingly complex puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thoughts for Food</h2><br>Find your way across carefully handcrafted and dream-like puzzle levels designed to melt your brain with various mechanics and hindrances.<br>The goal of each puzzle is to eat all the flowers, and then reach for the exit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every day is a Sluggle</h2><br>It\u2019s not easy being &quot;hangry&quot; when you\u2019re just a little gastropod having to deal with warping portals, different types of blocks, life-threatening elements and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Living that slug life</h2><br>You're a slug, and that makes you very cool.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303290/extras/38bbc6c28af847d332a8afd6a42f392d.poster.avif?t=1691076582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303290/extras/38bbc6c28af847d332a8afd6a42f392d.webm?t=1691076582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303290/extras/38bbc6c28af847d332a8afd6a42f392d.mp4?t=1691076582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Push, pull and rotate various materials with different properties, like clay or stone!<br></li><li>Transport objects and warp yourself through magical portals.<br></li><li>Manipulate rivers, avoid burning embers, and tread carefully on treacherous soil.<br></li><li>Ain\u2019t every day you can play a slug!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>A Slug\u2019s Dream</i> is a challenging yet accessible puzzle game about guiding an adorable slug dreaming about scrumptious flowers after skipping dinner through increasingly complex puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thoughts for Food</h2><br>Find your way across carefully handcrafted and dream-like puzzle levels designed to melt your brain with various mechanics and hindrances.<br>The goal of each puzzle is to eat all the flowers, and then reach for the exit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every day is a Sluggle</h2><br>It\u2019s not easy being &quot;hangry&quot; when you\u2019re just a little gastropod having to deal with warping portals, different types of blocks, life-threatening elements and more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Living that slug life</h2><br>You're a slug, and that makes you very cool.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303290/extras/38bbc6c28af847d332a8afd6a42f392d.poster.avif?t=1691076582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303290/extras/38bbc6c28af847d332a8afd6a42f392d.webm?t=1691076582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303290/extras/38bbc6c28af847d332a8afd6a42f392d.mp4?t=1691076582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Push, pull and rotate various materials with different properties, like clay or stone!<br></li><li>Transport objects and warp yourself through magical portals.<br></li><li>Manipulate rivers, avoid burning embers, and tread carefully on treacherous soil.<br></li><li>Ain\u2019t every day you can play a slug!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take on the role of a famished slug and wiggle your way through a series of challenging yet accessible puzzles. Push, rotate and warp anything that stands between you and those yummy flowers!",
